#: rc.cpp:17
msgid ""
"Usually IRC Servers are connected to a net (IRCNet, OpenProjects Net, etc.). "
"Here, you can select the closest server for your favorite network."
msgstr ""
"Normale IRC-serviloj estas ligitaj al reto (IRCNet, OpenProjects Net, "
